            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kintöghoghinto pipö Yaudi chane melö omekwa omisyewut cho kiropchini Tororöt ntökïtenö kïrumï tïsin nyo pöghisyegho Urim nko Tumim.*",
          "type": "text",
